"""
Merged Xilinhaote Code2 runner/trainer (single file)
====================================================

This file keeps the original Code2 v9 safePath training workflow and dual-network
runner logic, but integrates them into one short-name script for Xilinhaote.

What this merged script does:
  - runs both CNN_LSTM and TCN;
  - runs all configured Xilinhaote towers;
  - keeps the complete Code2 C0-C10 case set;
  - keeps direct WS/WD + T + logTKE target groups fixed where available;
  - keeps the drop rule for WD/U/V at 4 m and 50 m from the original code;
  - writes short folders and short case labels to reduce Windows MAX_PATH errors.

Generated by merging these original sources:
  - code2_train_profile_fair_ablation_..._fixed_v9_safePath.py
  - code2_drop_C0_C8_forceMOST_..._dual_network_runner_v9_safePath.py
"""
